CppChameleon - A recreation of the famous game "MECCHA CHAMELEON" in C++

HOW TO INSTALL:

You must ensure that you have already installed the following programs:

- Windows 10/11
- git: (not neccesary at all)
- CMake: MakeFiles configurator
- Make: "Scripting language" that builds the game
- C/C++ compiler


First of all, you need to clone the repository (or simply download it), you can do it with the next command

git clone https://github.com/meemknight/cppChameleon

Then, you must create a folder called "build", after that you will have to put this command in order to generate the makefile

cmake -S . -B build

After build the makefile, you enter to the build folder, and you will see a file called makefile, so the next step ant the final is executing it

make

After that, a executable will be created

